  "version": 1,
  "title": "Update Member Contact Information",
  "description": "Signs on to Meridian Core as a teller, searches Member Inquiry by member number, opens the member record, and submits the Update Member Information form with a new e-mail, phone and mailing address. This CHANGES DATA: it saves the member's contact details. Succeeds when the screen shows 'MEMBER INFORMATION UPDATED / CHANGES SAVED'.",
